`--stub-macro` pins a macro to a literal for this render: the value is the one from the flag, and it
is not a clock reading, so `date` never ran.

-- fixtures/cwd/probe.md.j2 --
stamp {{ macro('core.macros.date') }}
-- cmd --
booping render /proc/self/cwd/probe.md.j2 --stub-macro core.macros.date=19700101-00-00
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
stamp 19700101-00-00
-- stderr --
